QEMU, as built by beanjar-vendor (qemu/)

These programs are QEMU's release named in BUILDINFO, built from the upstream release tarball
(https://download.qemu.org/) with the patches in beanjar-vendor's qemu/patches/ applied, by the
build script next to them.

